# Markdown File Organization

All markdown (`.md`) files in this project belong in the `markdown/` subfolder.

- **When creating new markdown files**: Always create them in `markdown/` (e.g., `markdown/my-doc.md`)
- **When referencing markdown files**: Use paths relative to project root, e.g., `markdown/FILENAME.md`
- **Existing docs**: All project documentation lives in `markdown/`

This keeps the project root clean and documentation organized.
